(### 11.5 "Why SDET?" answer themes) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Strong answer:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(> I like software engineering, but I am especially interested in correctness, reliability, ) Tj
T*
(and automation. SDET lets me apply engineering skills to build test frameworks, tools, and ) Tj
T*
(high-signal coverage that improve product quality at scale. I enjoy not only building ) Tj
T*
(systems, but making them testable and dependable.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
